	J\'9fnk resources store info on specialized commodities that can be bought and sold at only one location (each). The fields are:\
\
SoldAt		ID number of the stellar object where the commodity is sold\
\
\cf2 BoughtAt		ID number of the stellar object where the commodity is purchased (or -1 for none)\cf0 \
\
BasePrice		The average price of the commodity (works much like the base prices for "regular" commodities)\
\
\cf2 Flags			Misc control bits (all but one unused)\
           0x0001		Tribbles flag - When in your cargo bay, the commodity multiplies like tribbles.}